@startuml JupiterSwapFlow
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Courier
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Strategy Service" as Client
participant "Jupiter SDK Layer\n(reqwest + signer)" as SDK
participant "Jupiter Swap API\nhttps://api.jup.ag/swap/v2" as API
participant "Solana RPC" as RPC
participant "Solana Validators" as Chain

Client -> SDK : Build quote params\n(SOL -> USDC amount)
SDK -> API : GET /order?inputMint=SOL&outputMint=USDC&amount
API --> SDK : Order tx + requestId
SDK -> SDK : Sign transaction\n(using SOL keypair)
SDK -> API : POST /execute\n(signedTransaction, requestId)
API -> RPC : Forward tx + priority fees
RPC -> Chain : Land transaction
Chain --> RPC : Confirmation + signature
RPC --> API : Finalized result
API --> SDK : ExecuteResponse (status, signature)
SDK --> Client : Notify swap result / failure handling

@enduml
